DTSTAMP:20261027T194803Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Oslo:20261029T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Oslo:20261029T190000
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Grinde på SAL: BUD1 – kap. 1\, s. 4–28 + kap. 2\, s. 29–34
DESCRIPTION:Drury\, Management Accounting for Business (9. utg.)\nKap. 1 In
 troduction to management accounting:\n  s. 4 (kapittelstart)\n  s. 5 The u
 sers of accounting information\n  s. 6 Differences between management acco
 unting and financial accounting\n  s. 7 The decision-making\, planning and
  control process\n  s. 11 The impact of the changing business environment 
 on management accounting\n  s. 19 Focus on customer satisfaction and new m
 anagement approaches\n  s. 22 Functions of management accounting\n  s. 23 
 Summary of the contents of this book\n  s. 26 Summary\n  s. 27 Key terms a
 nd concepts\n  s. 28 Assessment material\nKap. 2 An introduction to cost t
 erms and concepts:\n  s. 29 (kapittelstart)\n  s. 30 Cost objects\n  s. 31
  Manufacturing\, merchandising and service organizations\n  s. 31 Direct a
 nd indirect costs\n\nPensum: kap. 1–10\, 12 og 14–16 (BUD1-plan). Alle
  kapitler skal være gjennomgått innen 22.11.
CATEGORIES:BUD1
END:VEVENT
