UID:20261030-1600-BUD1@grindeplan-h26
DTSTAMP:20261027T194803Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Oslo:20261030T160000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Oslo:20261030T180000
TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Grinde på SAL: BUD1 – kap. 2\, s. 35–53 + kap. 3\, s. 56–76
DESCRIPTION:Drury\, Management Accounting for Business (9. utg.)\nKap. 2 An
  introduction to cost terms and concepts:\n  s. 35 Period and product cost
 s\n  s. 37 Cost behaviour\n  s. 41 Relevant and irrelevant costs and reven
 ues\n  s. 42 Avoidable and unavoidable costs\n  s. 43 Sunk costs\n  s. 44 
 Opportunity costs\n  s. 45 Incremental and marginal costs\n  s. 47 Control
 lable and uncontrollable costs\n  s. 48 The cost and management accounting
  information system\n  s. 49 Summary\n  s. 50 Key terms and concepts\n  s.
  51 Assessment material\nKap. 3 Cost-volume-profit analysis:\n  s. 56 (kap
 ittelstart)\n  s. 57 Curvilinear CVP relationships\n  s. 58 Linear CVP rel
 ationships\n  s. 60 A numerical approach to cost-volume-profit analysis\n 
