 in of safety\n  s. 66 Constructing the break-even or CVP chart\n  s. 67 Al
 ternative presentation of cost-volume-profit analysis\n  s. 70 Multi-produ
 ct cost-volume-profit analysis\n  s. 72 Operating leverage\n  s. 74 Cost-v
 olume-profit analysis assumptions and limitations\n  s. 76 The impact of i
 nformation technology\n\nPensum: kap. 1–10\, 12 og 14–16 (BUD1-plan). 
 Alle kapitler skal være gjennomgått innen 22.11.
